{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17894","headline":"赋山 · 令狐楚","name":"赋山","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"山，耸峻，回环。\n沧海上，白云间。\n商老深寻，谢公远攀。\n古岩泉滴滴，幽谷鸟关关。\n树岛西连陇塞，猨声南彻荆蛮。\n世人只向簪裾老，芳草空余麋鹿闲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"令狐楚","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17894.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17894","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}